## Origin

2026-08-08 — operator hard rule. Assessment-readiness tooling belongs online;
the binder reflects live program state; welcome letters, grading, testing, and
reminders are part of the workforce program; and everyone covered by a
regulatory requirement has an identity in the system while people performing no
regulated activity deliberately do not. Recorded alongside the operator's stated
identity trajectory — local accounts now, external identity management later —
because that trajectory is what makes person-record-bound evidence an
architectural invariant rather than a preference.
